      "shortMessageHtmlLink": {
        "value": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"The product is called gitquiet, and it has icons\n\nThe root package takes the name the interface already uses everywhere. Hugeicons\narrives for the bar&#39;s glyphs, and the desktop workspace takes Vite so the window\ncan be developed with a reload rather than a rebuild.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;\" class=\"Link--secondary\" href=\"/flazouh/githubpro/commit/15a0d74d4e1056e9ca83676f9e8ef58e0dafee42\">The product is called gitquiet, and it has icons</a>"
