      "shortMessageHtmlLink": {
        "value": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"The benchmarks and live checks follow the interface they drive\n\nEvery script that opens a real page had a selector or an address that the bar,\nHome and the renamed root moved. The checks are only worth keeping if they fail\nfor the right reason.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;\" class=\"Link--secondary\" href=\"/flazouh/githubpro/commit/af240e0e24d841f0c6920cea222e1c821b78ea02\">The benchmarks and live checks follow the interface they drive</a>"
