      "shortMessageHtmlLink": {
        "value": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"Write the WXT types on both sides of the engine build, as CI needs\n\nThe build reads the tsconfig `wxt prepare` writes, so it cannot run first;\nthe typecheck reads types written after the engine lands in `public`, so\none run cannot serve both.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;\" class=\"Link--secondary\" href=\"/flazouh/githubpro/commit/56394946bb8b5006cad915e4bc2b29579f4c6563\">Write the WXT types on both sides of the engine build, as CI needs</a>"
