        "value": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"Read a merged pull request GitHub requires nothing of\n\nTheir merge box answers `mergeRequirements: null` once a pull request has\nlanded. Refusing that payload failed the whole read, and a failed read\nleaves the last snapshot on screen, so a merged pull request went on\ncalling itself open.\n\nAlso lands the write-API notes, the conversation mockup, and the\npull-request diagnosis script used to find this.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;\" class=\"Link--secondary\" href=\"/flazouh/githubpro/commit/9f0c4c676740322ac77473dff5c5df5c156a8649\">Read a merged pull request GitHub requires nothing of</a>"
      }
